#. Settings: switch that checks for updates automatically.
msgctxt "upd_auto_check"
msgid "Check for updates automatically"
msgstr "自動檢查更新"

#. Settings: explanation under the automatic update check switch.
msgctxt "upd_auto_check_note"
msgid "Look for new releases shortly after launch and every six hours. Nothing is ever installed without a click."
msgstr "啟動後不久及每六小時尋找新版本。未經點擊絕不會安裝任何內容。"

#. Linux Settings update notice, AppImage installs: what the Install button does. The AppImage is the single-file Linux app; the VPN service is the separate system service package.
msgctxt "upd_available_appimage_message"
msgid "One click downloads the release, verifies it against the release's checksum and replaces this AppImage. The VPN service updates separately."
msgstr "按一下即可下載該版本，以該版本的校驗碼驗證，並取代此 AppImage。VPN 服務會另外更新。"

#. Windows update banner: what the Update button does (downloads the MSI installer, checks it, runs it).
msgctxt "upd_available_msi_message"
msgid "One click downloads the release, verifies it and runs its installer, which updates the app and the VPN service. The app closes while it installs."
msgstr "按一下即可下載並驗證該版本，然後執行其安裝程式，更新應用程式和 VPN 服務。安裝期間應用程式會關閉。"

#. Linux Settings update notice, package installs (.deb, .rpm, tarball) that the app does not replace itself. {file} is the release file name, for example urnetwork_2026.10.5_amd64.deb. The shell command is shown in the row below.
msgctxt "upd_available_package_message"
msgid "Download {} from the release page, then run the command below."
msgstr "從版本頁面下載 {}，然後執行下面的指令。"

#. Update notice title (Linux Settings, Windows update banner): a newer release is available. {version} is the release version, for example 2026.10.5-1024555910; keep the "v" before it.
msgctxt "upd_available_title_version"
msgid "Update available: v{}"
msgstr "有可用更新：v{}"

#. Linux Settings > General, the line under Check for updates: GitHub refused the update check with its rate limit (requests are anonymous and shared by everyone behind the same address) and said when it may be asked again; no check is sent before then, and the Check now button waits too. {time} is that local date and time.
msgctxt "upd_check_held_message"
msgid "GitHub asked this network to wait until {} before it is asked again, and the app waits until then."
msgstr "GitHub 要求此網絡在 {} 之前不要再次請求，應用程式會等到那時。"

#. Linux Settings > General: the button on the "Check for updates" row that checks for a new release now. The last check's outcome shows on the line under the row.
msgctxt "upd_check_now"
msgid "Check now"
msgstr "立即檢查"

#. Linux Settings > General: the sentence under upd_check_stale_title ("Couldn't check for updates since {date}"). The app checks again every six hours while automatic checks are on; "the button" is the row's Check now button.
msgctxt "upd_check_stale_message"
msgid "A newer release may be out. The app keeps trying every six hours, and the button tries now."
msgstr "可能已有更新的版本。應用程式會每六小時繼續嘗試，按鈕可立即嘗試。"

#. Linux Settings > General, the line under Check for updates, and the developer page's update line: shown while automatic checks are on and no update check has reached GitHub for more than 72 hours, because a release the app cannot see may be out. {date} is the local short date of the last check that did (or of the first launch that tried).
msgctxt "upd_check_stale_title"
msgid "Couldn't check for updates since {}"
msgstr "自 {} 起無法檢查更新"

#. Linux Settings update notice when the app cannot replace itself: the verified file's path is shown in the row below.
msgctxt "upd_downloaded_message"
msgid "This AppImage's folder is not writable, so the verified download was saved below. Replace the AppImage with it by hand."
msgstr "此 AppImage 所在的資料夾無法寫入，因此已將驗證過的下載檔案儲存在下方。請手動用它取代 AppImage。"

#. Update notice error (Linux Settings, Windows update banner): the downloaded file failed its integrity check and was deleted.
msgctxt "upd_failed_checksum"
msgid "The download didn't match the release's checksums, so it was discarded. Click to try again."
msgstr "下載的檔案與該版本的校驗碼不符，已被捨棄。按一下再試一次。"

#. Update notice error (Linux Settings, Windows update banner): the release download failed.
msgctxt "upd_failed_download"
msgid "The download didn't finish. Check the connection and click to try again."
msgstr "下載未完成。請檢查網絡連線，然後按一下再試一次。"

#. Linux Settings update notice error: the verified download could not be swapped in for the running AppImage.
msgctxt "upd_failed_install"
msgid "The AppImage couldn't be replaced. Check the folder's permissions and click to try again."
msgstr "無法取代 AppImage。請檢查資料夾權限，然後按一下再試一次。"

#. Linux Settings update notice: button that downloads, verifies and installs the update.
msgctxt "upd_install"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安裝"

#. Windows update banner when the installer could not be started: the user runs it by hand. Explorer is the Windows file manager.
msgctxt "upd_manual_install_message"
msgid "The installer didn't start (it needs administrator approval). The verified download was shown in Explorer — quit the app and run it."
msgstr "安裝程式未能啟動（需要管理員批准）。已在檔案總管中顯示驗證過的下載檔案 — 請結束應用程式後執行它。"

#. Linux Settings update notice once the update is installed and waiting for a relaunch.
msgctxt "upd_ready_message"
msgid "The new AppImage is in place and verified. Relaunch to start using it; the previous file is kept beside it until then."
msgstr "新的 AppImage 已就位並通過驗證。重新啟動即可開始使用；在此之前，舊檔案會保留在旁邊。"

#. Linux Settings update notice title once the new AppImage is installed. {version} is the release version; keep the "v" before it.
msgctxt "upd_ready_title"
msgid "Ready to relaunch: v{}"
msgstr "可以重新啟動：v{}"

#. Linux Settings update notice: button that restarts the app on the newly installed version.
msgctxt "upd_relaunch"
msgid "Relaunch"
msgstr "重新啟動"

#. Linux Settings update notice: button that opens the release's download page in the browser.
msgctxt "upd_release_page"
msgid "Release page"
msgstr "版本頁面"

#. Update notice button (Linux Settings, Windows update banner) that opens the folder holding the verified download.
msgctxt "upd_show_file"
msgid "Show file"
msgstr "顯示檔案"

#. Update notice progress line (Linux Settings, Windows update banner) while the release downloads.
msgctxt "upd_stage_downloading"
msgid "Downloading the update…"
msgstr "正在下載更新…"

#. Windows update banner progress line while the verified installer is being launched.
msgctxt "upd_stage_installing"
msgid "Starting the installer…"
msgstr "正在啟動安裝程式…"

#. Linux Settings update notice progress line while the verified download replaces the running AppImage file.
msgctxt "upd_stage_replacing"
msgid "Replacing the AppImage…"
msgstr "正在取代 AppImage…"

#. Update progress line (Linux Settings, Windows update banner, macOS Settings > Software update) while the downloaded release is checked against its published checksum.
msgctxt "upd_stage_verifying"
msgid "Verifying the download…"
msgstr "正在驗證下載…"

